: \"Cara Momo\". Cosa voleva dire suo padre? Un giorno, esplorando la soffitta della sua nuova casa, Momo trova un antico libro. E da quel momento, strani avvenimenti iniziano a verificarsi intorno a lei... sarà l’inizio di una fantastica avventura.","date":"2011","episodes_count":1,"episodes_length":120,"author":" ","created_at":"2020-07-18 17:21:35","status":"Terminato","imageurl_cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/10389-kHDDhvOUNsXm.jpg","type":"Movie","slug":"una-lettera-per-momo-ita","title_eng":"Una Lettera Per Momo (ITA)","day":"Indeterminato","favorites":31,"score":"7.85","visite":9152,"studio":"Production I.G","dub":1,"always_home":0,"members":225,"cover":null,"anilist_id":10389,"season":"Estate","title_it":"A Letter to Momo (ITA)","mal_id":10389,"crunchy_id":null,"netflix_id":null,"prime_id":null,"disney_id":null,"pivot":{"anime_id":5439,"related_id":2506,"number":1}}]},"archive":null},"sourceEpisodes":[{"id":82169,"anime_id":5439,"user_id":2,"number":"1","created_at":"2024-07-09 00:09:32","link":"Una.lettera.per.Momo.2011.1080p.AMZN.WEB-DL.JPN.DDP5.1.H.264.mkv","visite":3046,"hidden":0,"public":1,"scws_id":242595,"file_name":"Una.lettera.per.Momo.2011.1080p.AMZN.WEB-DL.JPN.DDP5.1.H.264.mkv","tg_post":0}],"artworkInventory":{"logo":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ybs88tEAbNnvDaGF83GptAYDltu.png"},{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt1853614/img"}],"poster":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A8AzalDsg4qViYUtwq07wgNF6Fn.jpg"},{"source":"tvdb","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/movies/6346/posters/6346.jpg"},{"source":"provider","url":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/bx10389-NMYFKRxI1WwJ.png"},{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/small/tt1853614/img"},{"source":"anilist","url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx10389-NMYFKRxI1WwJ.png"}],"background":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"http